 "remarks": "Charming first-floor apartment in an 1840 Colonial in Wilton's Cannondale section with a front porch and private entrance. Spacious living room and inviting kitchen with ample storage, electric range, dishwasher, and counter seating. Comfortable bedroom with two closets and a full hallway bath. Ample parking, utilities and trash pickup included, with pets encouraged. Convenient to train, downtown Wilton, Wilton High School and Route 7 Connector. Annual lease required. Owner just added brand new, in unit laundry. See this today!",
